Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:07.44,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:17.98,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1936,1874.666)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.84,0:00:10.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,大家好 Windows活到头了
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.84,0:00:10.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone, it's over.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.89,0:00:12.07,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,在众多科技公司中 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.89,0:00:12.07,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Among other corporations,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.25,0:00:15.09,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,微软一直在研发年龄验证系统 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.25,0:00:15.09,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Microsoft has been working on the age verification system,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.35,0:00:19.09,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看来Windows系统很快将要求用户提供身份证明才能运行 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.35,0:00:19.09,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and it seems Windows will soon require an ID from you to operate.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.65,0:00:21.15,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,最新的累积更新 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.65,0:00:21.15,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The recent cumulative update,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.43,0:00:25.93,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,编号KB5079473 发布于2026年3月10日 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.43,0:00:25.93,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,KB5079473, dated March 10th,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.99,0:00:28.87,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,带来了几项改进 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.99,0:00:28.87,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,2026, introduced a couple improvements,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.13,0:00:32.47,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,例如他们优化了Windows Defender应用程序控制功能 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.13,0:00:32.47,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,like for example they've improved the Windows Defender application control,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.03,0:00:41.19,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个工具也恰好用于锁定Windows 10 S和Windows 11 SE版本 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.03,0:00:41.19,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,the tool that's also incidentally used to lock down Windows 10 S and Windows 11 SE versions,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.35,0:00:45.65,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,同时还更新了人工智能组件 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.35,0:00:45.65,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,along with the updates to AI components,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.49,0:00:48.83,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,具体包括图像搜索 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.49,0:00:48.83,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,specifically image search,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.35,0:00:52.81,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,内容提取和语义分析功能 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.35,0:00:52.81,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,content extraction, and semantic analysis.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.04,0:00:55.49,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但更新日志并未提及 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.04,0:00:55.49,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The changelog, however,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.69,0:00:58.99,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,系统中隐藏的额外功能 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.69,0:00:58.99,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,fails to mention an extra hidden feature inside the system.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.65,0:01:01.85,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在让我们一探究竟 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.65,0:01:01.85,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let's have a look at that.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.85,0:01:03.01,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,更重要的是 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.85,0:01:03.01,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But more importantly,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.21,0:01:04.91,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如果您想亲自验证这些信息 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.21,0:01:04.91,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,if you want to verify all that yourself,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.03,0:01:07.73,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,可以访问uupdump.net网站 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.03,0:01:07.73,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,you can head over to the uupdump.net website,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.03,0:01:11.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,选择最新的公开发行版本 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.03,0:01:11.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,then select the latest public release build,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.91,0:01:12.97,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,然后根据系统架构进行选择
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.91,0:01:12.97,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and select your architecture,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.33,0:01:16.89,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我的系统是x64架构 选择更新项后
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.33,0:01:16.89,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,mine is x64, and select the update,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.13,0:01:21.93,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,接下来可以任意选择所需版本
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.13,0:01:21.93,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,next, you can select any edition you want,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.97,0:01:25.75,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,最关键的是必须勾选包含更新
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.97,0:01:25.75,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and most importantly you need to include updates,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.85,0:01:27.81,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,务必勾选这个包含更新的选项框
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.85,0:01:27.81,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,you need to tick that box to include updates,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.81,0:01:32.47,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,然后就能创建下载包并开始获取ISO镜像
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.81,0:01:32.47,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and then you can create the download package and get your ISO going.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.83,0:01:35.55,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,好的 我们现在要安装最新的Windows镜像
Dialogue: 2,0:01:32.83,0:01:35.55,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Okay, so we're going to install the latest Windows image,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.93,0:01:39.61,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,先完成镜像解压步骤
Dialogue: 2,0:01:35.93,0:01:39.61,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and let's get the image decompression out of the way,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.92,0:01:45.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在已进入系统初始化设置界面
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.92,0:01:45.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and we're in the out-of-box experience now.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个功能隐藏得相当隐蔽
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So this feature is fairly well hidden,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.12,0:01:50.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们需要执行几条命令来启用它
Dialogue: 2,0:01:48.12,0:01:50.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and we'll have to fire up a couple commands here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.64,0:01:54.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但首先 让我演示通过oobe安装Windows的标准流程
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.64,0:01:54.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But first, let me walk you through the normal process of setting up Windows through the oobe.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.21,0:01:58.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,首先需要设置地区选项
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.21,0:01:58.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So first, you set up the region,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.82,0:02:00.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,接着选择键盘布局
Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.82,0:02:00.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,then the keyboard layout,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.50,0:02:06.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,从2025版开始 系统强制要求网络连接
Dialogue: 2,0:02:02.50,0:02:06.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and since like 2025, you're forced to have internet connectivity.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.78,0:02:08.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个步骤无法跳过
Dialogue: 2,0:02:06.78,0:02:08.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You cannot skip that.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.58,0:02:11.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所以我们必须连接网线
Dialogue: 2,0:02:08.58,0:02:11.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So we have to connect our wire,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.07,0:02:16.71,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.07,0:02:16.71,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,then
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.77,0:02:28.43,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,点击下一步 系统会自动接收强制更新
Dialogue: 2,0:02:20.77,0:02:28.43,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,we click next, and we receive mandatory updates.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.35,0:02:33.13,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,接着会被强制要求登录微软账户
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.35,0:02:33.13,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And then you are coerced into connecting your Microsoft account,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.25,0:02:34.17,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,前提是你得有账户
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.25,0:02:34.17,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,if you even have one.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.55,0:02:37.67,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个界面甚至没有创建本地账户的选项
Dialogue: 2,0:02:34.55,0:02:37.67,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There's not even an option to create a local account here,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.79,0:02:39.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你只能点击登录
Dialogue: 2,0:02:37.79,0:02:39.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,so you just press sign in.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.49,0:02:44.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当前页面同样无法创建本地账户
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.49,0:02:44.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You don't have a way to create a local account on this page either,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.31,0:02:46.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,于是只能进入登录选项
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.31,0:02:46.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,so you're headed into sign in options.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.97,0:02:49.15,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但这里依然没有相关功能
Dialogue: 2,0:02:46.97,0:02:49.15,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And there is not even a way to do it here,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.27,0:02:56.13,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,只能返回选择“工作或学校设置”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:49.27,0:02:56.13,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,so you just hop back and select the setup for work or school,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.99,0:03:03.53,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,结果再次被强制要求连接微软账户
Dialogue: 2,0:02:58.99,0:03:03.53,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and then you're again coerced into connecting your Microsoft account,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.67,0:03:06.87,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,接着点击登录选项 选择域加入
Dialogue: 2,0:03:03.67,0:03:06.87,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,then you click on the sign in options and you can domain join instead,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.63,0:03:11.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,实际上这终于能创建本地账户了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.63,0:03:11.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which in reality means you can create a local account after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.63,0:03:14.61,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,完成这套繁琐流程后
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.63,0:03:14.61,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Once you've completed that song and dance,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.73,0:03:17.97,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你才真正获得电脑的控制权
Dialogue: 2,0:03:14.73,0:03:17.97,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,you finally have the control over your computer.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.81,0:03:23.37,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在让我们运行这个新更新带来的神奇命令
Dialogue: 2,0:03:18.81,0:03:23.37,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Now let's run a magic command with this new update installed and present.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.43,0:03:38.03,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个命令将为设备启用身份验证策略
Dialogue: 2,0:03:34.43,0:03:38.03,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,this command will enable the ID verification policy for the machine.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.70,0:03:42.43,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们很快会重启进入oobe界面
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.70,0:03:42.43,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We will reboot into the oobe again shortly.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.55,0:03:48.29,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,好的 现在进入oobe了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:46.55,0:03:48.29,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're in the oobe,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.65,0:03:52.85,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,按常规流程进行设置
Dialogue: 2,0:03:48.65,0:03:52.85,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,so let's just set everything up as usual.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.32,0:03:58.90,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但当我们尝试域加入时
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.32,0:03:58.90,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But, once we domain join,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.20,0:04:00.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,出现了这种情况
Dialogue: 2,0:03:59.20,0:04:00.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,here's what happens.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.58,0:04:02.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,年龄验证
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.58,0:04:02.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Age verification.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.46,0:04:05.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,请验证您的年龄
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.46,0:04:05.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Please verify your age.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.74,0:04:09.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,需要确认身份以确保数据安全
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.74,0:04:09.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We need to confirm your identity to ensure safety of your data.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.44,0:04:14.80,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如您所见 这里出现了Copilot图标提示
Dialogue: 2,0:04:10.44,0:04:14.80,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,As you can see, we've got a copilot icon here saying,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.26,0:04:17.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,请将身份证件举到摄像头前
Dialogue: 2,0:04:15.26,0:04:17.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,please hold your ID up to the camera.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.90,0:04:21.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,由于虚拟机未配置摄像头
Dialogue: 2,0:04:18.90,0:04:21.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And I don't have a camera set up in the VM,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.66,0:04:22.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我无法继续操作
Dialogue: 2,0:04:21.66,0:04:22.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,so I cannot continue.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.10,0:04:25.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,继续按钮呈灰色不可用状态
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.10,0:04:25.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The continue button is just grayed out.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.44,0:04:26.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,完全失效
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.44,0:04:26.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It doesn't work.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.44,0:04:32.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我既不能返回也无法继续 因为系统没有提供其他选项
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.44,0:04:32.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I cannot go back and I cannot proceed either because I'm not given an option.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.20,0:04:36.80,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,微软Copilot不知为何要求我扫描身份证件
Dialogue: 2,0:04:33.20,0:04:36.80,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Microsoft Copilot is instructing me to scan my ID for some reason.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.56,0:04:39.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我手边现在也没有身份证件
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.56,0:04:39.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Not that I have an ID on me right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.56,0:04:41.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,实际上我甚至不记得把它放哪儿了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.56,0:04:41.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Actually, I don't even remember where I put it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.06,0:04:43.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,已经很久没见过了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:42.06,0:04:43.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Haven't seen it in a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.68,0:04:47.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但话说回来 我为什么要向微软出示身份证呢
Dialogue: 2,0:04:43.68,0:04:47.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But anyways, why would I even want to show my ID to Microsoft?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.42,0:04:51.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,使用系统根本不需要这个
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.42,0:04:51.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I don't need it to use the system.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.26,0:04:52.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是我的电脑
Dialogue: 2,0:04:51.26,0:04:52.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's my computer.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.14,0:04:54.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不需要你们来保障我的数据安全
Dialogue: 2,0:04:52.14,0:04:54.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You don't need to ensure the safety of my data.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.82,0:04:57.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我自己会负责
Dialogue: 2,0:04:55.82,0:04:57.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I will ensure it myself.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.98,0:05:00.98,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所以我的第一个想法是直接跳过这个验证环节
Dialogue: 2,0:04:57.98,0:05:00.98,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So my first idea is to just completely skip the obby.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.34,0:05:03.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,设置虚拟机完全不需要这个步骤
Dialogue: 2,0:05:01.34,0:05:03.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You don't need it to set up the machine.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.62,0:05:04.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这根本就是可选项
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.62,0:05:04.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's completely optional,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.98,0:05:05.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 2,0:05:04.98,0:05:05.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,actually.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.24,0:05:09.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,幸好命令提示符完全没有被屏蔽
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.24,0:05:09.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, the command prompt is not blocked at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.36,0:05:13.94,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我和Flytech用进程监视器追踪了这个命令的功能
Dialogue: 2,0:05:10.36,0:05:13.94,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Me and Flytech traced what the command does using process monitor.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.18,0:05:16.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它正在设置注册表项
Dialogue: 2,0:05:14.18,0:05:16.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And it's setting a registry value
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.68,0:05:38.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:36.68,0:05:38.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.80,0:05:41.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,在这个键下有三个数值
Dialogue: 2,0:05:38.80,0:05:41.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Under that key, we've got three values.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.26,0:05:45.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,第一个是IDV策略启用状态
Dialogue: 2,0:05:42.26,0:05:45.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,First one is IDV policy enabled,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.34,0:05:47.40,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,执行命令后这个值被设为1
Dialogue: 2,0:05:45.34,0:05:47.40,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which is set to 1 after that command.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.99,0:05:49.94,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,然后是IDV策略级别
Dialogue: 2,0:05:47.99,0:05:49.94,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Then we've got IDV policy level,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.14,0:05:51.06,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个值设为0
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.14,0:05:51.06,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which is set to 0.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.28,0:05:52.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我不太清楚具体含义
Dialogue: 2,0:05:51.28,0:05:52.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I don't really know what that is.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.16,0:05:56.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,还有个UUID
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.16,0:05:56.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And we've gotten a UUID,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.60,0:05:57.80,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,应该是遥测标识符
Dialogue: 2,0:05:56.60,0:05:57.80,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I guess, a telemetry ID.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.58,0:06:01.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我猜这个值用于年龄验证的后台系统
Dialogue: 2,0:05:58.58,0:06:01.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I guess this value is used for the age verification backend.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.98,0:06:04.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在我对这些数值束手无策
Dialogue: 2,0:06:01.98,0:06:04.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Now, I can't really do anything with those values.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.58,0:06:07.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,能查看但无法修改
Dialogue: 2,0:06:04.58,0:06:07.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I can see them, but I cannot modify them.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.02,0:06:12.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如你所见 尝试写入新值时出现错误
Dialogue: 2,0:06:09.02,0:06:12.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,As you can see, we get an error writing the values new contents.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.96,0:06:15.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们也可以尝试删除它
Dialogue: 2,0:06:12.96,0:06:15.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And we can also try deleting that,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.36,0:06:17.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但同样无法删除
Dialogue: 2,0:06:15.36,0:06:17.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but we are unable to delete that.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.06,0:06:20.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,接下来我检查了访问控制列表
Dialogue: 2,0:06:18.06,0:06:20.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Next thing I checked was the ACL.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.12,0:06:28.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,即使尝试授予自己对注册表键值的完全控制权
Dialogue: 2,0:06:21.12,0:06:28.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And allowing myself full control over the key and its values,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.72,0:06:30.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,仍然会收到访问被拒的提示
Dialogue: 2,0:06:28.72,0:06:30.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,we get access denied.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.52,0:06:32.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所以这条路根本行不通
Dialogue: 2,0:06:30.52,0:06:32.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So we can't do that at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.78,0:06:35.94,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,基本上就是无法操作
Dialogue: 2,0:06:33.78,0:06:35.94,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So it's just basically not possible.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.26,0:06:41.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,情况就是这样
Dialogue: 2,0:06:40.26,0:06:41.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.20,0:06:44.68,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们对这些数值完全无能为力
Dialogue: 2,0:06:41.20,0:06:44.68,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So we can't do anything about these values.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.86,0:06:49.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们也可以尝试删除注册表键本身
Dialogue: 2,0:06:45.86,0:06:49.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We can also try deleting the key itself.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.16,0:06:51.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,数值消失了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.16,0:06:51.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The values disappear,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.78,0:06:53.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但事实并非如此
Dialogue: 2,0:06:51.78,0:06:53.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but no, they actually don't.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.30,0:06:57.06,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我认为这是用户选择保护驱动在起作用
Dialogue: 2,0:06:54.30,0:06:57.06,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I think it's the work of the user choice protection driver.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.20,0:07:02.94,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs 160}这是微软先前用来阻止第三方浏览器将自己设为默认浏览器的驱动程序 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:57.20,0:07:02.94,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's a driver Microsoft previously used to prevent third-party browsers from setting themselves as the default one.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.92,0:07:05.76,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,微软这招确实挺不地道的
Dialogue: 2,0:07:03.92,0:07:05.76,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's really scummy from Microsoft,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.06,0:07:08.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但 唉 我们还能怎么办呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:06.06,0:07:08.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but, well, what more can we do?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.48,0:07:17.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我发现绕过年龄验证检查的方法 是在启用IDV策略标志的情况下
Dialogue: 2,0:07:09.48,0:07:17.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So the workaround I found to skip the age verification check with the IDV policy enabled flag set was to activate the
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.30,0:07:24.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,激活管理员账户 通过输入 net user administrator /active 命令
Dialogue: 2,0:07:17.30,0:07:24.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,administrator user by typing net user administrator /active.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.50,0:07:27.86,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,命令执行成功
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.50,0:07:27.86,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The command completed successfully.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.18,0:07:33.90,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,接着清除defaultuser0账户
Dialogue: 2,0:07:28.18,0:07:33.90,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Then getting rid of the defaultuser0.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.90,0:07:40.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,然后重启计算机
Dialogue: 2,0:07:33.90,0:07:40.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And then rebooting the machine.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.64,0:07:47.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,操作后oobe界面仍会出现并要求年龄验证
Dialogue: 2,0:07:43.64,0:07:47.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The oobe still appears and requests age verification after that move,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.52,0:07:51.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但我们可以再次终止进程 这将激活第二层oobe
Dialogue: 2,0:07:47.52,0:07:51.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but we can kill it again and it's going to activate the second chance oobe,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.56,0:07:53.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,该界面不会要求身份验证
Dialogue: 2,0:07:51.56,0:07:53.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which won't request the ID.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.26,0:08:16.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在第二层oobe就在这里启动了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:13.26,0:08:16.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Now we get the second chance OB right here.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.68,0:08:21.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我认为特别有趣的是微软使用了ClipSVC
Dialogue: 2,0:08:17.68,0:08:21.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What I deem super interesting is that Microsoft used ClipSVC,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.82,0:08:24.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,即客户端授权服务
Dialogue: 2,0:08:21.82,0:08:24.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,aka the client license service.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.52,0:08:26.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让我快速演示一下
Dialogue: 2,0:08:24.52,0:08:26.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let me show you that real quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.62,0:08:33.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们可以在服务菜单中找到客户端授权服务
Dialogue: 2,0:08:27.62,0:08:33.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We can look into the services menu and find the client license service right here.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.94,0:08:38.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这项服务主要负责管理微软商店的数字版权管理
Dialogue: 2,0:08:33.94,0:08:38.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's the service that basically manages the Microsoft Store DRM.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.98,0:08:44.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看起来他们正在扩展其功能来收集用户的敏感数据
Dialogue: 2,0:08:39.98,0:08:44.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And it looks like they're extending its functionality to gather sensitive data from people.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.28,0:08:50.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,整件事最令人不安的是我们数字隐私的脆弱性
Dialogue: 2,0:08:45.28,0:08:50.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The scariest part about this whole ordeal is how fragile our digital privacy is,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.30,0:08:57.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,特别是强制用户向第三方提供身份信息竟如此简单 目的却不得而知
Dialogue: 2,0:08:50.30,0:08:57.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and especially how easy it is to force people into sharing their identification to the third parties for unknown purposes.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.64,0:09:04.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看来Windows强制身份验证的全球推行正日益临近
Dialogue: 2,0:08:58.64,0:09:04.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're coming closer and closer to the global rollout of this forced ID verification on Windows.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.78,0:09:06.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Linux的时代即将到来
Dialogue: 2,0:09:04.78,0:09:06.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The decade of Linux is coming.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.90,0:09:09.78,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,拒绝年龄验证 请多保重
Dialogue: 2,0:09:06.90,0:09:09.78,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Say no to age verification and take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.53,0:09:29.49,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur30\fscx151\fscy153\pos(1944,742.666)}在 Youtube 上关注
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.83,0:09:25.59,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1978.286,1517.714)}原标题：Windows ID Verification is Here 原作者：Enderman\N原视频上传日期：2026年4月2日\N翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果\N\N字幕制作不易，喜欢的话支持一下我吧！
